This program reads the moisture level from the VH400 sensor connected to an MCP3008 ADC via SPI0 and controls a relay on GPIO18 based on the moisture level compared to a configurable threshold. It logs all moisture readings and pump activation/deactivation events with timestamps to `irrigation.log`. It handles SPI communication errors by retrying up to three times per read and ensures the pump is off on all exit paths, including SIGINT and SIGTERM signals. The program accepts command-line options `-t` for threshold, `-d` for pump duration, and `-s` for sleep interval.

