This program initializes GPIO and I2C, reads the WHO_AM_I register to verify the sensor, and enters a loop where it continuously reads the TOF distance. If the distance falls below the specified threshold, it lights up an LED connected to GPIO 17. The distance readings are logged to a file named "tof_log.txt" with timestamps. On any exit, including SIGINT, it cleans up resources.

**Important Notes:**

