```bash
gcc -o vl53l4x_distance vl53l4x_distance.c -lgpiod -lvl53l1x
```

This code assumes that the `VL53L4X` library is correctly set up and that the sensor is connected to the Raspberry Pi Zero W on I2C bus 1. Adjust the I2C address and bus number if necessary for your setup.

