This program initializes the GPIOs, reads the touch sensor, toggles the relay, handles signals, and cleans up resources properly. It uses `libgpiod` for GPIO operations and includes error checking for every `gpiod` API call. The program also debounces the touch sensor input and handles the scenario where the touch sensor remains continuously HIGH for more than 10 seconds by forcing the relay OFF and ignoring further toggles until the sensor is released.

